Descriptor CourseIdentificationSystem
	documentation 'This descriptor defines a standard code that identifies the organization of subject matter 
	'and related learning experiences provided for the instruction of students.
    with optional map type
		item CSSC course code
		item Intermediate agency course code
		item LEA course code
		item NCES Pilot SNCCS course code
		item Other
		item SCED course code
		item School course code
		item State course code
		item University course code
